<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Aldfrith of Lindsey</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aldfrith-of-northumbria">Aldfrith</a> of Lindsey is the last king of Lindsey known from the surviving Anglian royal genealogies and from his witness to a charter of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/offa-of-mercia">Offa of Mercia</a> in the late 8th century. By then Lindsey, the small kingdom around Lincoln, was under Mercian overlordship, and no later independent rulers are recorded.</p></div>
